    {
      "id": 1,
      "slug": "laozi-abstract",
      "title": "摘要",
      "link": "https://dhchina.wordpress.com/abstract/",
      "modified_gmt": "2025-05-07T07:36:30",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">本研究利用訓練BERT模型對四庫全書中老子其人的相關描述進行自動分類，並通過調用Deepseek等LLM模型進行信息生成幫助訓練，訓練後的模型平均準確率達0.9以上，在使用此模型對TXT格式的四庫全書進行分類後，獲得了老子其人描述的相關文本數據庫，并通過「吾與點」平臺進行智能標注。數據可為老子其人形象的演變與發展研究提供支持。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized wp-duotone-unset-1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"463\" height=\"1023\" data-attachment-id=\"81\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/abstract/%e7%8e%84%e5%a6%99%e8%a7%80%e8%80%81%e5%ad%90/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e78e84e5a699e8a780e88081e5ad90.webp\" data-orig-size=\"750,1658\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"玄妙觀老子\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e78e84e5a699e8a780e88081e5ad90.webp?w=463\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e78e84e5a699e8a780e88081e5ad90.webp?w=463\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-81\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.4647201201017188;width:403px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e78e84e5a699e8a780e88081e5ad90.webp?w=463 463w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e78e84e5a699e8a780e88081e5ad90.webp?w=68 68w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e78e84e5a699e8a780e88081e5ad90.webp?w=136 136w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e78e84e5a699e8a780e88081e5ad90.webp 750w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 463px) 100vw, 463px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Figure 2 Attributed to Wu Daozi吳道子,<em> The figure of Laozi engraved on Tablet</em>. China, Tang dynasty. Inscriptions on a tablet, 1.8* 0.88*0.3 m. Su Zhou, Xuanmiao Temple.</figcaption></figure>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "slug": "laozi-limitations",
      "title": "研究限制",
      "link": "https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e7%a0%94%e7%a9%b6%e9%99%90%e5%88%b6/",
      "modified_gmt": "2025-05-07T08:24:20",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">本研究通過BERT模型對四庫全書中老子的相關内容進行分類，雖然目前正確率較高，但仍有提升空間，如訓練數據集在數量上仍有提升空間，但由於AI工具生成的重複與幻覺問題，訓練數據集若進一步完善需要人工進行收集和查找。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">此外本研究致力於服務老子其人的相關研究，但由於篩選之後數據較多，且四庫全書沒有標點，雖然通過北大吾與點平臺進行處理，但從效果看，在平臺與工具的選擇與使用上仍需要進一步嘗試，並需要考慮人工的再處理。人工處理與檢驗可極大提升數據庫的質量。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">此外從結果來看，最終仍有一些錯誤存在，需要對數據進一步的處理。但考慮到本研究以篩選數據為目標，對技術的大量投入耗費的時間如果大於人工處理的所需時間，亦不免有本末倒置之嫌疑。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">故老子其人描述的數據集建設仍有很大進步空間。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"561\" height=\"1024\" data-attachment-id=\"120\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e7%a0%94%e7%a9%b6%e9%99%90%e5%88%b6/image-6/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-6.png\" data-orig-size=\"796,1454\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"image\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-6.png?w=561\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-6.png?w=561\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-120\" srcset=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-6.png?w=561 561w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-6.png?w=82 82w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-6.png?w=164 164w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-6.png?w=768 768w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-6.png 796w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 561px) 100vw, 561px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Figure 4 Zhang Lu, <em>Laozi Riding an Ox</em>, Ming dynasty, the National Palace Museum.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "slug": "laozi-results",
      "title": "分析結果",
      "link": "https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e5%88%86%e6%9e%90%e7%b5%90%e6%9e%9c/",
      "modified_gmt": "2025-05-07T10:04:21",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">本研究通過Kaggle平臺進行編程訓練BERT模型，Notebook如下：</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-69bbf988 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/fengyu111/fengyu-bert-finetuning\">代碼鏈接</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在通過BERT模型的訓練與處理之後，可得到老子其人描述的相關數據集，鏈接如下：</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-69bbf988 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CtugTVhmtwAYzC45GbbbgUIv_OgHa8DI?usp=drive_link\">數據集鏈接</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在得到相關數據之後，筆者使用北京大學「吾與點」智能標注平臺對數據進行了初步處理，此内容仍在完善與進行當中。部分的初步内容（仍需要長期完善）如下：</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file aligncenter\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-95c10ec6-e3c6-4722-9c5e-5b66f44c7ef8\" href=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e88081e5ad90e585b6e4babae68f8fe8bfb0_1746522549934.table_.excel_entity_list.xlsx\">老子其人描述</a><a href=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e88081e5ad90e585b6e4babae68f8fe8bfb0_1746522549934.table_.excel_entity_list.xlsx\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-95c10ec6-e3c6-4722-9c5e-5b66f44c7ef8\">下载</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-69bbf988 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://app.wyd.pkudh.net/project\">平臺鏈接</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在經過模型的分類之後，我們能做到在過去無數字化時代下人力絕難以達到的事情，從四庫全書中篩選出這些老子其人的相關文本，這些文本有的和宗教相關，有的與神話相關，有的則以史料的身份出現，通過模型所篩選出的這些數據，能夠很好地幫助我們以一個更加周詳的、完備的角度去仔細研究老子這個人在歷史上的形象，在文本中的描述與構建。這既是一種還原真實人物考古式的資料挖掘，又是一個人物形象接受史的探究。雖然此數據集的構建仍有很多待完善之處，但對於老子的研究而言，筆者已為數字技術所打開的新希望的大門而雀躍，期待繆斯女神的降臨以為此兩千年前至今的賢者形象研究帶來新氣象。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img data-attachment-id=\"135\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e5%8d%97%e5%ae%8b%e6%b3%95%e5%b8%b8%e8%80%81%e5%ad%90%e5%9c%96-3/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e58d97e5ae8be6b395e5b8b8e88081e5ad90e59c96-1-edited.webp\" data-orig-size=\"1242,1864\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"南宋法常老子圖\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e58d97e5ae8be6b395e5b8b8e88081e5ad90e59c96-1-edited.webp?w=682\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e58d97e5ae8be6b395e5b8b8e88081e5ad90e59c96-1-edited.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-135\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.6663196251952108;width:332px;height:auto\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Figure 6 Muxi牧谿, <em>Portrait of Laozi</em>, Thirteenth century (South Song dynasty), the Okayama Prefectural Museum of Art.</figcaption></figure>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "slug": "laozi-methods",
      "title": "分析方法",
      "link": "https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e5%88%86%e6%9e%90%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95/",
      "modified_gmt": "2025-05-07T08:17:06",
      "content": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignright size-large is-resized\"><img data-attachment-id=\"154\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/image-9/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-8-edited.png\" data-orig-size=\"393,662\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"image\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-8-edited.png?w=393\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-8-edited.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-154\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.5936700668741718;width:179px;height:auto\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Figure 5 Zhao Mengfu, <em>Tao Te Ching with regular script in small characters,</em> Yuan dynasty, The Palace Museum.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">本研究旨在探索如何從大批量混合文本中識別與老子其人的相關內容，可選擇的方法有BERT模型分類，使用API調用LLM模型進行分類，或使用編程語言按照關鍵詞「老子」進行篩選。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">最終選擇利用預訓練模型Siku_bert，添加使用一千餘條數據訓練的分類器形成BERT模型，對四庫全書中關於老子其人的描述進行自動分類，從而得到數據集。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">這種技術相較於其他兩者的優勢在於以下兩點：</p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>LLM模型在分類時會產生幻覺，將一些老子相關内容略過，將老子内容判斷爲非老子内容，同時由於處理過程的黑箱，很難對模型進行調整訓練來提高正確率。筆者進行對比後發現BERT模型在篩選過程中錯誤類型則基本為將非老子内容判斷爲老子内容，雖然會造成數據的冗餘，但能夠盡量保留老子相關的内容，并且在進行對比測試之後，BERT模型準確度也與LLM模型相比更高（詳見BLOG）。</li>\n\n\n\n<li>通過關鍵詞進行篩選速度快於其他兩種方法，但在進行數據收集的過程中，筆者發現如果使用老子為關鍵詞，所得到的内容多爲老子道德經的重複内容，不利於進行分析，使用BERT模型則可以在訓練後篩選掉道德經的内容。</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">故選擇BERT模型進行訓練分析，目標包括：</p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>區分文本是否描述老子：從混合文本中識別與老子其人相關的內容。</li>\n\n\n\n<li>分析分類錯誤原因並改進：模型錯誤分類内容與老子内容的關聯以及如何解決。</li>\n\n\n\n<li>構建數據集：借用其他平臺對數據進行二次加工（初步嘗試）。</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在通過人工收集二百條數據之後，使用LLM模型生成獲取了一千條訓練數據。之後使用預訓練模型&#8221;SIKU-BERT/sikubert&#8221;作爲底層模型，使用一千條數據訓練上部分類器，最終獲得訓練好的BERT模型。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">其中訓練過程中設置如下：</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-syntaxhighlighter-code \"><pre class=\"brush: plain; title: ; notranslate\" title=\"\">\nval_split=0.2,\nepochs=3,\nbatch_size=16,\n</pre></div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">訓練效果為：</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"460\" data-attachment-id=\"146\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e5%88%86%e6%9e%90%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95/image-7/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png\" data-orig-size=\"1795,808\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"image\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png?w=1024\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-146\" style=\"width:366px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png?w=1024 1024w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png?w=150 150w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png?w=300 300w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png?w=768 768w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png?w=1440 1440w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-7.png 1795w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Epoch</th><th>Training Loss</th><th>Validation Loss</th><th>Accuracy</th><th>Precision</th><th>Recall</th><th>F1</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>0.340400</td><td>0.076115</td><td>0.982063</td><td>0.982240</td><td>0.982063</td><td>0.982072</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>0.065000</td><td>0.047820</td><td>0.986547</td><td>0.986924</td><td>0.986547</td><td>0.986557</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>0.028300</td><td>0.019251</td><td>0.995516</td><td>0.995558</td><td>0.995516</td><td>0.995517</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">當調整epoch為4時，從損失來看，四輪訓練損失降低不明顯，故仍進行三輪訓練</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"284\" data-attachment-id=\"185\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e5%88%86%e6%9e%90%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png\" data-orig-size=\"1666,463\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png?w=1024\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-185\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3.5985942991019133;width:506px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png?w=1024 1024w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png?w=150 150w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png?w=300 300w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png?w=768 768w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png?w=1440 1440w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/0f5ee6b2523ecf0379e0506028a6a8e.png 1666w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">當調整batch為36時，F1未提升，反而下降，在之前訓練中亦使用50、70等數值，效果亦較差。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"254\" data-attachment-id=\"188\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e5%88%86%e6%9e%90%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png\" data-orig-size=\"1588,394\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png?w=1024\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-188\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4.03161320316132;width:444px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png?w=1024 1024w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png?w=150 150w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png?w=300 300w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png?w=768 768w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png?w=1440 1440w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5e79b9ad5ca23c59de7380a0ad0ee9c.png 1588w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">最終保留原有設定，檢驗為：</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"601\" data-attachment-id=\"186\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/%e5%88%86%e6%9e%90%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png\" data-orig-size=\"1564,919\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png?w=1024\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-186\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.7018762003250112;width:355px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png?w=1024 1024w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png?w=150 150w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png?w=300 300w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png?w=768 768w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png?w=1440 1440w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ee8a74ec48d01dc59a5ee07206fac49.png 1564w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\">{'eval_loss': 0.019816875457763672,\n 'eval_accuracy': 0.9954995499549955,\n 'eval_precision': 0.995500642666985,\n 'eval_recall': 0.9954995499549955,\n 'eval_f1': 0.9954992863290504,\n 'eval_runtime': 4.3217,\n 'eval_samples_per_second': 257.074,\n 'eval_steps_per_second': 8.099}</pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">由此可看出模型效果較爲不錯，可以對文本進行分類處理。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">為確認模型準確程度，筆者在四庫全書中隨機選擇了一萬字文本，並加入「老子是中國偉大的哲學家」一句充當positive數據，由此對模型的預測功能進行驗證，最終成功篩選出老子一句。結果如下：</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file aligncenter\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-9dff96b8-8f1b-4023-b6d3-22a75f741c52\" href=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e6b8ace8a9a6.docx\">預測效果測試</a><a href=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/e6b8ace8a9a6.docx\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-9dff96b8-8f1b-4023-b6d3-22a75f741c52\">下载</a></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">最終在進行訓練之後，將四庫全書的全部文本分成不同的TXT文檔，使用BERT模型進行分類，輸出爲TXT文檔。最終得到老子其人的相關描述，並嘗試使用北大吾與點平臺對分類結果進行自動標點與實體標注（由於平臺效率，仍在調整中）。</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "slug": "laozi-dataset",
      "title": "數據集",
      "link": "https://dhchina.wordpress.com/dataset/",
      "modified_gmt": "2025-05-06T04:05:24",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">本次研究訓練BERT模型所使用的數據集來源有兩種，一者為筆者手動收集，共有257條訓練數據，二者為由Deepseek等AI模型搜索與生成的訓練數據，兩類數據共計約一千餘條（過程見BLOG）。此數據集包含兩類標簽，代表「是老子其人的描述」的文本被標記成1，「非老子其人的描述」的文本被標記為0，這些數據以json格式被保存。在經過這些數據訓練後，模型基本可對混合文本進行分類。</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file aligncenter\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-1a51b5ef-4e3a-4a27-90ff-c4be6d89c2a8\" href=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/laozi1000.docx\"><strong>laozi1000</strong></a><a href=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/laozi1000.docx\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-1a51b5ef-4e3a-4a27-90ff-c4be6d89c2a8\">下载</a></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">訓練完成的模型所進行分類的數據集為txt版本的四庫全書，在通過編程分割為300字左右的文本段后使用BERT模型進行處理。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"929\" height=\"1023\" data-attachment-id=\"93\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/dataset/chenhongshou-laozi/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"4992,5500\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Camera 3&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;Sinarback eVolution 75, Sinar p3 / f3&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1274708549&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"chenhongshou laozi\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg?w=929\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg?w=929\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-93\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.9081234480312167;width:472px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg?w=929 929w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg?w=1858 1858w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg?w=136 136w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg?w=272 272w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg?w=768 768w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chenhongshou-laozi.jpg?w=1440 1440w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 929px) 100vw, 929px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Figure 3 Chen Hongshou, <em>Laozi Riding an Ox</em>, Ming dynasty, the Cleveland Museum of Art.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": 193,
      "slug": "laozi-note-193",
      "title": "簡介",
      "link": "https://dhchina.wordpress.com/2025/05/07/%e7%b0%a1%e4%bb%8b/",
      "modified_gmt": "2025-05-07T08:43:28",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">本網站通過數字手段與傳統方法進行交叉研究，目標為老子其人的形象分析。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">目前的研究為利用訓練BERT模型對四庫全書中老子其人的相關描述進行自動分類，並通過調用Deepseek等LLM模型進行信息生成幫助訓練，訓練後的模型平均準確率達0.9以上，在使用此模型對TXT格式的四庫全書進行分類後，獲得了老子其人描述的相關文本數據庫，并通過「吾與點」平臺進行智能標注。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">可為老子其人形象的演變與發展研究提供數據支持。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img data-attachment-id=\"195\" data-permalink=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/2025/05/07/%e7%b0%a1%e4%bb%8b/image-10/\" data-orig-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-9.png\" data-orig-size=\"456,1454\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"image\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-9.png?w=321\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"321\" height=\"1023\" src=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-9.png?w=321\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-195\" style=\"width:283px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-9.png?w=321 321w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-9.png?w=47 47w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-9.png?w=94 94w, https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/image-9.png 456w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 321px) 100vw, 321px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Figure 7 Chao Buzhi晁補之, <em>Laozi Riding an Ox</em>, Northern Song Dynasty, the National Palace Museum.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "slug": "laozi-note-14",
      "title": "老子其人事跡——文本分類工具選擇",
      "link": "https://dhchina.wordpress.com/2025/05/06/%e8%80%81%e5%ad%90%e5%85%b6%e4%ba%ba%e4%ba%8b%e8%b7%a1-%e5%9f%ba%e6%96%bcbert%e7%9a%84%e6%96%87%e6%9c%ac%e5%88%86%e9%a1%9e%e6%8e%a2%e7%b4%a2/",
      "modified_gmt": "2025-05-06T07:36:12",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在歷代文獻中進行文本挖掘，隨之而來的問題自然而言是以何種方式進行挖掘，其中較爲適用的兩種方法是訓練BERT模型與通過API調用LLM模型對文本進行挖掘，筆者在對比兩者優缺點後，最終選擇訓練BERT模型進行分類，並通過DEEPSEEK模型進行訓練數據生成，下面展示對比情況。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">為對比兩種方法的準確程度，筆者構建了一個名爲“test_ai_bert.txt”的文件，包含三十個例子，其中含有五個老子其人的描述例文。</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file aligncenter\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-d8a1c89b-1bb0-4691-b34b-45b17e068986\" href=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/test_ai_bert.docx\">test_ai_bert</a><a href=\"https://dhchina.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/test_ai_bert.docx\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-d8a1c89b-1bb0-4691-b34b-45b17e068986\">下载</a></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">經過測試，三十個例子中DEEPSEEK模型兩次判斷的錯誤數量爲一至兩個，而BERT模型通過一千條左右的訓練數據，可以做到全對。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在訓練過程中，BERT模型曾使用三百條的較小訓練數據集進行訓練，在之後測試中出現兩次錯誤，其中老子的相關的内容均被判斷正確，但關於張道陵和蚩尤的内容被誤判為老子其人的相關内容。但在擴充訓練數據之後，這種錯誤被解決。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">而在Deepseek的分類中，兩次分類中似乎都產生幻覺，如「浮屠老子流，营营盈市廛」一句被認爲是「文本中的『浮屠』指佛教，與老子無關。」最終對老子相關内容判斷錯誤，而對非老子相關内容全部判斷正確。由於LLM模型的黑箱特性，筆者尚未找到這種錯誤類型的解決方法。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">故在二者準確率相似的情況下，BERT模型對老子相關内容的判斷效果更好，故筆者選擇使用BERT模型進行篩選。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">以下為相關代碼：</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-69bbf988 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/drive/15oDbsygZezldZJP54Fv1cFHkS2iUo095?usp=sharing\">AI分類代碼</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/fengyu111/fengyu-bert-finetuning\">BERT分類代碼</a></div>\n</div>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "slug": "laozi-note-6",
      "title": "LLM模型對訓練BERT模型的幫助",
      "link": "https://dhchina.wordpress.com/2025/04/27/llm%e6%a8%a1%e5%9e%8b%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%93%e7%b7%b4bert%e6%a8%a1%e5%9e%8b%e7%9a%84%e5%b9%ab%e5%8a%a9/",
      "modified_gmt": "2025-05-06T07:41:51",
      "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">本研究在訓練BERT模型的過程中，使用DEEPSEEK與PERPLEXITY等AI工具進行訓練數據的生成來幫助BERT模型訓練。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">由於關於老子其人描述的數據集目前在網絡上不存在，故而只能通過手動收集的方式進行處理，那麽如何收集老子其人的相關資料，就成爲一個問題。筆者首先嘗試保守方法，即在古籍中尋找相關記載，但速度過慢。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">之後筆者嘗試詢問AI工具，在其給出古籍文本後進行驗證，但DEEPSEEK等模型聯網搜索數據的能力有限，在搜索到幾十條數據後，AI的幻覺較多并且重複生成相似内容。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">之後筆者嘗試使用中華經典古籍庫和識典古籍平臺以老子為關鍵詞進行搜索，但搜索后絕大部分的文本則為「老子曰」字樣的道德經内容，由此導致篩選數據的速度緩慢，如果想要通過人工收集數據來訓練模型，所投入的時間會很多，由此便與使用數字技術來高效率處理的初衷本末倒置。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">故筆者嘗試結合手動搜索之後得到的數據與DEEPSEEK與PERPLEXITY等AI工具結合，使其模仿生成訓練數據。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在手動收集了二百余條數據并以json格式儲存之後，筆者上傳文件至DEEPSEEK等模型，並要求生成與附件相似的數據，最終生成以下類似數據：</p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>&#091;\n{\n\"text\": \"老子任周守藏室史时，曾整理夏商周三代的龟甲卜辞，以星象推演历法。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"周景王二十三年，老子观彗星袭月，预言王室将有内乱，次年王子朝果叛乱。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"楚平王建章华台，老子谏以「高台多殃」，后章华台果毁于柏举之战。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"周王室东迁时，老子护送九鼎图至成周，途中遇盗，以德感化贼众。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"老子幼时师从商容，学三皇五帝之书，能倒诵《连山》《归藏》。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"传老子双掌有先天八卦纹，左手乾坎艮震，右手巽离坤兑，掌纹如刻。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"周考王封老子为柱下史时，赐玄圭赤绶，老子悬绶于庭示「功成不居」。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"老子暮年隐于景室山，凿石为室，门徒见其室中常现紫气缭绕。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"老子晚年手植梧桐于濑乡，树皮天生裂纹似古篆「道」字。\",\n\"label\": 1\n},\n{\n\"text\": \"老子幼时名耳，因耳垂过肩，乡老言其「具黄帝四目之相」。\",\n\"label\": 1\n}\n]</code></pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在LLM模型這種信息生成下，最終得到了一千餘條訓練數據（在一定數量之後同樣產生幻覺與内容重複），在通過這些數據的訓練之後，最終BERT模型準確率在多次測試中均達到0.9以上。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">由此可看出將不同工具進行結合使用有利於數字人文的研究與分析。</p>\n"
    }
  ],
